  "title": "Наказание Макса и закрытый вход  (Max's Punishment and the VIP Entrance)",
  "level": "A1 — Duolingo Section 2",
  "labels": {
    "barinov": "Шеф",
    "max": "Макс"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Exhausted from working non-stop after losing both Vika and Sasha, Max scrubs the kitchen and wonders aloud whether he was a tyrant in a past life to deserve such punishment. Outside the restaurant, he watches wealthy VIP guests pull up in luxury cars and asks the Chef if ordinary cooks ever get invited into that elite world.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Верить теории буддистов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Наверное, даже был Гитлером.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Иначе я не понимаю?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "За что мне такое наказание?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Как ты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А ведь если бы я туда попал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, а можно с вами?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Даже не мечтаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Они никого с собой не берут.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы для них никто.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это элита.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А ты-то кто?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я здесь уже три года работаю.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right, let's take their exchange slowly and unpack the Russian.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Верить теории буддистов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you believe the theory of the Buddhists.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Наверное, даже был Гитлером.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was probably even Hitler in a past life.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Иначе я не понимаю?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Otherwise I just do not understand it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "За что мне такое наказание?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did I do to deserve such punishment?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Как ты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How are you holding up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А ведь если бы я туда попал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And yet if I ever made it in there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, а можно с вами?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, can I come along with you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Даже не мечтаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not even dream about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Они никого с собой не берут.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They never bring anyone along with them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы для них никто.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To them, we are nobodies.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это элита.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is the elite.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А ты-то кто?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And who do you think you are?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я здесь уже три года работаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have been working here for three years already.'",
      "gap": 0.9
