    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That wraps up this scene as working without days off after losing both Vika and Sasha, Max wonders what sins he committed in a past life while watching rich VIP guests arrive at Claude Monet. Until next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
